/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:20:#      water color, and the inward column repeats the structure color. Outside the legend,
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:21:#      fresh water starts in source stacks while old water may already occupy deep basin
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:23:#    - Combo output: only the fresh-water color moves. Old water stays where it is and acts
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:27:#      If a basin already contains two `old` cells at the floor, the incoming `fresh` cells
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:35:#      small: background, structure, fresh water, old water.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:36:#    - Old water is always present in multiple cells, not just one marker pixel, so the
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:40:#    - `water = 1` no longer holds. The solver must decode the moving-water color from the
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:42:#    - Every pixel of the water color used to be movable. That is false now because one
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:43:#      legend cell shares the fresh-water color but must remain fixed, so legend cells are
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:45:#    - Previously all non-background non-water colors were just solids. Now the old-water
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:48:#      while only fresh-water cells outside the legend are iterated and moved.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:55:#      basin geometry already respects bounds and non-overlap constraints.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:57:#      structure or source water.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:58:#    - Old-water carryover cells are selected from a solved basin state and then pasted back
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:59:#      into background basin cells only, so they are guaranteed to be in-bounds and stable.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:63:#      basin walls. The outer column visibly contains the two water-role colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:64:#    - Because fresh water changes position between input and output while old water does not,
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:66:#    - Fresh water is never color 1 in generated samples, so solving by memorizing blue=water
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:70:#    - The scene has three clean regions: a small corner legend, one basin/wall family, and
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/40/code.py:73:#      separate cue rather than being woven into the basin walls.
